  \texttt{predLangevin} & Predicts locations bridging irregular observations. \\
  \texttt{residuals} & Calculates one-step-ahead residuals for goodness-of-fit diagnostics. \\
  \texttt{simLangevin} & Simulates movement tracks from scratch or from fitted models. \\
  \bottomrule
  \end{tabular}
\end{table}

